{"name": "Angel Guardian", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/0a75da6fa2aeec428e657ba1453b054a.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"856\"/></span>Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter built around fast combat, smart movement, and constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a sudden attack cripples the Space Station kingdom of Alterra, its systems turn against you \u2014 and survival becomes the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"524\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/83876e26869abb0341fd900861c86ab2.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"856\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive using multiple tools and playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, fast-paced shooting built for constant movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect 8 double-upgradeable rifles plus a sword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth options to avoid combat or strike quietly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hacking systems to disable defenses, crack codes, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly enemies and boss encounters that demand quick reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/bee35a926420f97d0e97b428564981b4.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"856\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Angel Guardian features Twitch Chat Integration that lets viewers affect the game in real time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn enemies right in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop ammo when you\u2019re desperate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger Eiji\u2019s superpowers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run becomes unpredictable \u2014share the IDs with your chat and let them unleash mayhem live while you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/3c759216814304c07f4d4d57b90cbf02.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"856\"/></span>You play as <strong>Kita</strong>, a warrior guardian sent to extract a young prince after the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the journey unfolds, the prince fights alongside you, unlocking powerful abilities while you help him awaken his true potential as the kingdom\u2019s rightful heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not an escort mission. This is a fight to take control back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"188\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cafeb410eada88402a5caec98c4878dc.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"856\"/></span>Tested by 100+ players across multiple closed test sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/d7ec72d802ae0322a6b499795c2f82e3.avif?t=1785797243\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist now to stay updated and not miss the launch. See you out there, Guardian!</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter set in a space station under attack. Play as Kita, a warrior guardian on a mission to rescue the young prince while fighting hostile enemies. Use shooting, stealth and hacking to face powerful bosses and prove yourself as a true guardian.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/3da9515c202c6f25a4dd86ddc65b9c0d9ea42478/header.jpg?t=1785797243", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Platformer", "Metroidvania", "Sci-fi", "Anime", "Cyberpunk", "Bullet Hell"], "developers": "Corgee inc", "publishers": "Corgee inc", "release_date": "Nov 3, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2508440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/APKlmvmYPrA", "first_seen": 1785708000.0, "review_rank": 194}